...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

ui: Streamlit UI { class: ours }
openai_api: OpenAI API { class: ext }
memory: mem0 Memory { class: ours }
qdrant: Qdrant { class: store }

ui -> memory: "add(answer, user_id=user_id)"
memory -> openai_api: 사실 추출(gpt-4o-mini)·임베딩(text-embedding-3-small) 요청
memory -> qdrant: 유사 기억 검색(limit=5, user_id 필터)
memory -> qdrant: 새 메모리 저장(컬렉션 llm_app_memory)
